  },
  "notes": {
    "nav": "Four keys on this chassis, not six. Home (X11 110) and End (X11 115) have no addressable LED - they are Fn-layer functions.",
    "characters": "Includes ISO_Extra (X11 94), the <> key present on ISO layouts. Upstream omits it.",
    "delete": "Delete (nav) and KP_Delete (numpad) are distinct keys and may hold different colours.",
    "enter_esc": "Both Enter keys: Return on the main block and KP_Enter on the numpad. Upstream's alias covered Esc and Return only."
  },
